even further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204350/extras/045ccaf73f754cbce0800c5c1ccb0601.poster.avif?t=1778107091\" width=1000 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204350/extras/045ccaf73f754cbce0800c5c1ccb0601.webm?t=1778107091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Black Market is alive and influences your heists</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the Black Market, you can sell highly valuable loot, whose price changes every day, and access Black Market Missions. These special missions allow you to dramatically manipulate your heists to maximize your loot in exchange for harder challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204350/extras/e1b64d08fd7afc8e7a9b220a98e49ab7.poster.avif?t=1778107091\" width=1000 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204350/extras/e1b64d08fd7afc8e7a9b220a98e49ab7.webm?t=1778107091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover the story of Midnight City</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are two major Operation campaigns featuring a total of  60+ missions that you can complete right alongside your heists. Each mission offers rewards like experience points, money, or special skins you can't get anywhere else. Every mission is packed with exciting story content, pulling you right into the middle of the action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"